  "details": "I am posting this on behalf of a friend. I also have his logs if need be. He has been having this issue since mid-2020 and it has caused him to take hiatuses for how annoying it is. \n\nAs long as he is in his initial home world, his social menu will update fine. However, as soon as he joins a new world it stops updating. Friends that are offline appear online until he clicks them (and vice versa). The worlds friends are in don't update. This even extends to invites, as he won't receive any. This includes accepted invites to requests he sent, or invites initially sent by someone else. He keeps the VRChat website open at all times in order to actually receive invites. The only way to \"reset\" his social menu is to restart the game entirely.",
